"""Document delivery, increment 1: messages and the outbox (R112, design/document-delivery.md §8).

Five new tables -- ``delivery_templates``, ``delivery_files``, ``delivery_messages``, ``delivery_message_documents``
and ``delivery_events`` -- with guards: events, attached files and frozen bytes never change or go, messages and
templates are never deleted. Three nullable ``company_info`` columns (``delivery_reply_to``, ``delivery_copy_to``,
``delivery_auto_flag_from``). One default template per kind is seeded, so every company can draft at once. Moves no
stored row. DDL below is frozen: this migration never imports current application metadata.
"""
